And I think that was something that I had to stop myself

3090
02:09:54.470 --> 02:09:57.760
because when I knew I wasn't race racing, New York hard,

3091
02:09:57.760 --> 02:09:59.320
I was like, sign me up for Boston.

3092
02:09:59.320 --> 02:10:01.270
I need a narrative for myself in the world

3093
02:10:01.270 --> 02:10:02.400
about what's happening next.

3094
02:10:02.400 --> 02:10:05.070
And that has been my emo for so many years

3095
02:10:05.070 --> 02:10:08.390
'cause we're so used to these, just putting it out there.

3096
02:10:08.390 --> 02:10:09.840
And I think what you're saying is,

3097
02:10:09.840 --> 02:10:13.380
before you sign up for the next goal,

3098
02:10:13.380 --> 02:10:16.650
recalibrate or check in on these values

3099
02:10:16.650 --> 02:10:18.300
to see is that the appropriate goal,

3100
02:10:18.300 --> 02:10:20.040
which brings us full circle to what you said

3101
02:10:20.040 --> 02:10:21.780
in the beginning, that if we don't do that,

3102
02:10:21.780 --> 02:10:24.050
we might chase the wrong goal.

3103
02:10:24.050 --> 02:10:26.920
And also, I mean, important areas, what you were saying,

3104
02:10:26.920 --> 02:10:29.360
check in, but that's where I would also like,

3105
02:10:29.360 --> 02:10:31.110
and I always encourage my athletes

3106
02:10:31.110 --> 02:10:33.670
well check in with your family.

3107
02:10:33.670 --> 02:10:34.503
How'd you do?

3108
02:10:35.826 --> 02:10:37.340
How was that journey with them?

3109
02:10:37.340 --> 02:10:39.630
Because you need them and their support

3110
02:10:39.630 --> 02:10:43.110
to continue this endurance endeavor big time.

3111
02:10:43.110 --> 02:10:46.170
It just doesn't work without them being a part of it,

3112
02:10:46.170 --> 02:10:48.950
or at least being heard or knowing that,

3113
02:10:48.950 --> 02:10:51.005
you know what, I didn't burn any bridges.

3114
02:10:51.005 --> 02:10:53.460
signing up for the next event without checking in with them.

3115
02:10:53.460 --> 02:10:58.460
It turns it into, why is a dad doing 10 hours of yard work?

3116
02:11:00.560 --> 02:11:02.697
He must've signed up another race.

3117
02:11:06.610 --> 02:11:08.880
And so those are things that are important with that.

3118
02:11:08.880 --> 02:11:11.930
Like how did I do on my let's say athlete mission statement

3119
02:11:11.930 --> 02:11:12.763
up until now,

3120
02:11:12.763 --> 02:11:13.697
did I stick to the values

3121
02:11:13.697 --> 02:11:15.640
and the things that were important to me?

3122
02:11:15.640 --> 02:11:17.220
Did I compromise anything?

3123
02:11:17.220 --> 02:11:19.150
And how can I do this better next time

3124
02:11:19.150 --> 02:11:20.730
while still enjoying myself

3125
02:11:20.730 --> 02:11:22.640
and achieving these amazing outcomes

3126
02:11:22.640 --> 02:11:23.790
that I was looking for.

3127
02:11:26.221 --> 02:11:27.133
All right, guys.

3128
02:11:28.340 --> 02:11:29.680
To the new year.

3129
02:11:29.680 --> 02:11:30.513
Cheers.

3130
02:11:31.855 --> 02:11:33.653
Final thoughts wrap up.

3131
02:11:38.630 --> 02:11:41.050
I think this is an important conversation

3132
02:11:41.050 --> 02:11:45.000
'cause I personally think a lot of people

3133
02:11:45.000 --> 02:11:46.760
don't know where to start with it.

3134
02:11:46.760 --> 02:11:50.743
So hopefully we can have addressed some questions if any,

3135
02:11:52.690 --> 02:11:55.030
and there's no perfect way,

3136
02:11:55.030 --> 02:11:56.710
I think is what I took from this.

3137
02:11:56.710 --> 02:11:59.530
There no one size fits all

3138
02:11:59.530 --> 02:12:03.763
everyone has a different way of setting goals.

3139
02:12:05.730 --> 02:12:10.730
I had like a little epiphany recently about goal chasing

3140
02:12:10.830 --> 02:12:12.000
that I will share,

3141
02:12:12.000 --> 02:12:14.290
'cause I think it would've been nice to know

3142
02:12:14.290 --> 02:12:15.800
10 years ago or something,

3143
02:12:15.800 --> 02:12:18.780
which is that I feel like we can fixate,

3144
02:12:18.780 --> 02:12:19.900
look, we've been through this.

3145
02:12:19.900 --> 02:12:22.150
You could fixate on the goal itself

3146
02:12:22.150 --> 02:12:26.019
and it's hard to be told, enjoy the journey.

3147
02:12:26.019 --> 02:12:28.640
Those platitudes never spoke to me.

3148
02:12:28.640 --> 02:12:31.300
Like if anyone said anything that I felt was a platitude,

3149
02:12:31.300 --> 02:12:32.563
I was like, eh, whatever.

3150
02:12:33.700 --> 02:12:38.460
But I was recently I'll admit it.

3151
02:12:38.460 --> 02:12:43.460
I auditioned for SNL and I in the process,

3152
02:12:43.479 --> 02:12:46.320
it was a goal of mine ever since I was young

3153
02:12:46.320 --> 02:12:47.600
because I loved that stuff.

3154
02:12:47.600 --> 02:12:50.330
And I had the most fun I've ever had in my life

3155
02:12:50.330 --> 02:12:51.770
putting together my audition.

3156
02:12:51.770 --> 02:12:53.250
You know I did that.

3157
02:12:53.250 --> 02:12:56.820
And I would go to bed every night, really so happy

3158
02:12:56.820 --> 02:13:01.330
and then so sad because I wanted it to last forever.

3159
02:13:01.330 --> 02:13:04.360
Like I wanted to get it so that I could do that forever.

3160
02:13:04.360 --> 02:13:06.883
And I was sad that I might not be able to do something

3161
02:13:06.883 --> 02:13:09.220
that made me so happy forever.

3162
02:13:09.220 --> 02:13:12.110
And I had this epiphany then

3163
02:13:12.110 --> 02:13:14.000
where I was like, wait a minute,

3164
02:13:14.000 --> 02:13:16.010
whether I get the goal or not,

3165
02:13:16.010 --> 02:13:19.690
the goal that it was not up to me, it's not up to me.

3166
02:13:19.690 --> 02:13:22.063
Sometimes these goals are not up to us.

3167
02:13:22.063 --> 02:13:26.100
The steps that I'm taking along the way are the same.

3168
02:13:26.100 --> 02:13:27.610
Like I was pursuing it with integrity.

3169
02:13:27.610 --> 02:13:28.540
I was trying my best.

3170
02:13:28.540 --> 02:13:32.627
I was in it as if the same, if get it or not.

3171
02:13:32.627 --> 02:13:35.410
And I realized that when we're chasing a dream,

3172
02:13:35.410 --> 02:13:39.940
if we are pursuing it fully committed or ritualizing it,

3173
02:13:39.940 --> 02:13:41.640
all the words,

3174
02:13:41.640 --> 02:13:44.860
you are in the dream while you are chasing it.

3175
02:13:44.860 --> 02:13:46.310
And I think so often we think

3176
02:13:46.310 --> 02:13:49.320
that we are only getting the dream once we actually get it.

3177
02:13:49.320 --> 02:13:51.870
But most of the time is that lead up

3178
02:13:51.870 --> 02:13:55.450
and we should allow ourselves to really enjoy the process.

3179
02:13:55.450 --> 02:13:57.990
And again, if someone said enjoy the journey,

3180
02:13:57.990 --> 02:14:00.740
I would have been like, it means nothing to me.

3181
02:14:00.740 --> 02:14:02.830
But once I realized that every day

3182
02:14:02.830 --> 02:14:05.093
I was showing up to put that audition together

3183
02:14:05.093 --> 02:14:06.870
and I didn't get it,

3184
02:14:06.870 --> 02:14:09.270
I might keep trying some people don't get it the first time,

3185
02:14:09.270 --> 02:14:13.580
but it doesn't matter because I was so happy in that process

3186
02:14:13.580 --> 02:14:15.556
of fully committing and doing it.

3187
02:14:15.556 --> 02:14:19.210
And I wanna pursue my goals moving forward like that

3188
02:14:19.210 --> 02:14:22.523
instead of the person who's obsessing over only the result.

3189
02:14:23.440 --> 02:14:25.964
And so I hope that helps anyone who like,

3190
02:14:25.964 --> 02:14:30.003
felt similarly skeptical about that thing.

3191
02:14:32.333 --> 02:14:34.680
There's that quote of,

3192
02:14:34.680 --> 02:14:37.013
it's not a question of the outcome of the goal,

3193
02:14:37.013 --> 02:14:38.700
it's who you become in the process

3194
02:14:38.700 --> 02:14:43.298
of giving it all you have in order to get the goal.

3195
02:14:43.298 --> 02:14:47.140
So that's sort of a way of saying it's about the journey,

3196
02:14:47.140 --> 02:14:48.620
which you also sort of said.

3197
02:14:48.620 --> 02:14:50.580
Yeah, you're definitely saying that.

3198
02:14:50.580 --> 02:14:52.927
Yeah, no, I am saying it, but I'm saying

3199
02:14:52.927 --> 02:14:57.200
if you don't resonate with one platitude,

3200
02:14:57.200 --> 02:14:59.570
like some people, if it doesn't resonate with you,

3201
02:14:59.570 --> 02:15:01.870
it might never resonate in those words,

3202
02:15:01.870 --> 02:15:03.480
like maybe you heard it from the wrong person,

3203
02:15:03.480 --> 02:15:04.480
like your second grade teacher

3204
02:15:04.480 --> 02:15:06.090
and you didn't like that person.

3205
02:15:06.090 --> 02:15:08.890
But if you try and find other ways into,

3206
02:15:08.890 --> 02:15:11.300
these platitudes are real and they have meaning,

3207
02:15:11.300 --> 02:15:14.060
but sometimes those words are a blur

3208
02:15:14.060 --> 02:15:15.550
'cause you've heard them from the wrong people.

3209
02:15:15.550 --> 02:15:16.620
You've heard them too many times,

3210
02:15:16.620 --> 02:15:18.120
you've seen them on Instagram.

3211
02:15:20.140 --> 02:15:22.290
There's always another way to look at a platitude

3212
02:15:22.290 --> 02:15:24.570
that hopefully makes it true for you.

3213
02:15:24.570 --> 02:15:27.640
So it's okay if one doesn't resonate with you,

3214
02:15:27.640 --> 02:15:29.630
we can find another way in.

3215
02:15:29.630 --> 02:15:30.610
So yeah, I get it.

3216
02:15:30.610 --> 02:15:32.270
I believe in it enjoy the journey,

3217
02:15:32.270 --> 02:15:36.240
but I needed to like learn it in a different way I think.

3218
02:15:36.240 --> 02:15:39.030
Or just visualize it too.

3219
02:15:39.030 --> 02:15:40.003
No words needed.

3220
02:15:40.960 --> 02:15:43.840
At least that's my, I mean, I agree different ways.

3221
02:15:43.840 --> 02:15:47.040
You know, for me, it's what I've been saying.

3222
02:15:47.040 --> 02:15:49.760
It's who do you wanna be and I think it's a daily exercise,

3223
02:15:49.760 --> 02:15:50.990
it's a monthly exercise.

3224
02:15:50.990 --> 02:15:54.110
It's a yearly exercise that you can go short-term long-term

3225
02:15:54.110 --> 02:15:57.950
because it's just a constant reminder of what my actions are

3226
02:15:57.950 --> 02:15:59.010
in this current moment.

3227
02:15:59.010 --> 02:16:00.850
Who do I want to be?

3228
02:16:00.850 --> 02:16:03.670
Who do I wanna be when I walk out that door today?

3229
02:16:03.670 --> 02:16:06.910
Who do I wanna be when I show up at this workout today?

3230
02:16:06.910 --> 02:16:11.780
Who do I wanna be in April when spring happens?

3231
02:16:11.780 --> 02:16:13.600
Who do I wanna be this summer

3232
02:16:13.600 --> 02:16:15.290
for these events I signed up for?

3233
02:16:15.290 --> 02:16:17.450
Who do I wanna be in for my kids?

3234
02:16:17.450 --> 02:16:19.860
Who do I wan to be?

3235
02:16:19.860 --> 02:16:23.130
And be with a capital BE which you guys saw me

3236
02:16:23.130 --> 02:16:24.650
write you guys about.

3237
02:16:24.650 --> 02:16:29.650
Because being is acting, it's an action, being.

3238
02:16:30.700 --> 02:16:33.973
And so that's sort of, you're constantly thinking,

3239
02:16:33.973 --> 02:16:36.370
this is what I believe in and I do

3240
02:16:36.370 --> 02:16:39.940
and I try to every day, is who do I wanna be?

3241
02:16:39.940 --> 02:16:44.220
Who did I wanna be coming to talk to you today?

3242
02:16:44.220 --> 02:16:47.920
And although it's constantly that awareness of reflecting

3243
02:16:47.920 --> 02:16:50.850
