3246
02:16:59.070 --> 02:17:01.350
who do I wanna be when I do this presentation,

3247
02:17:01.350 --> 02:17:02.950
when I take this action,

3248
02:17:02.950 --> 02:17:04.720
when I come home from work tonight,

3249
02:17:04.720 --> 02:17:06.670
when I go to the gym today.

3250
02:17:06.670 --> 02:17:09.400
